  "body": "809sqm Freehold Land\r\nBeautiful Mixed-Use property.\r\nCan be commercial or residential (or both)\r\nIdeal for development for townhouses or apartments\r\nExisting 251sqm building has 9 rooms, two large lounges, 2 bathrooms and 2 separate toilets. \r\nUsed to be a medical centre, so ideal for a home based business or office space.\r\nRow of shops , bakery, cafe next door. Bus stop right outside. Few minutes walk to the beach and Eastridge shopping mall. 2 minutes walk to Selwyn College.",
